OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FVariable amounts of cloud and
OL,6,Fsome bright or sunny spells, best of
OL,7,Fthe sunshine across the east. There
OL,8,Fwill be a scattering of showers, these
OL,9,Fmost frequent across the west. Fresh
OL,10,Fto strong west or southwesterly winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FThis evening will see
OL,13,Fscattered showers, mainly in the north
OL,14,Fand west. Then showers will become
OL,15,Ffewer and lighter during the early
OL,16,Fhours. Fresh westerly winds easing a
OL,17,Flittle.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
