OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FAfter a dry morning cloud and
OL,6,Frain will spread east for a time in
OL,7,Fthe afternoon. Turning drier in the
OL,8,Fevening.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FA few
OL,11,Fshowers in the west on Saturday,
OL,12,Flargely dry in the east, windy. Dry
OL,13,Fand bright on Sunday. Rain for a time
OL,14,Fearly on Monday then dry.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
